            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词条 + Corrections"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms are sent only to engines that support transcription-time biasing": {
      "comment": "A description of how a term is used.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用語は文字起こし時のバイアス指定に対応するエンジンにのみ送信されます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词条仅发送给支持转录时偏置设置的引擎"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms are sent to the transcription service for better recognition": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Begriffe werden an den Transkriptionsdienst gesendet für bessere Erkennung"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "認識精度向上のため、用語は文字起こしサービスに送信されます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词条会发送到转录服务以提高识别准确率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms depend on engine support. Corrections always run after transcription.": {
      "comment": "A description of the terms of the engine support.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用語はエンジンの対応状況に依存します。修正は文字起こし後に常に実行されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词条 取决于 在 引擎 支持. Corrections 始终 运行 之后 transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms help only on engines that support transcription-time biasing. Corrections always run after transcription and apply across engines.": {
      "comment": "A description of the functionality of the terms and corrections.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用語は文字起こし時のバイアス指定に対応するエンジンでのみ有効です。修正は常に文字起こし後に実行され、すべてのエンジンに適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词条仅在支持转录时偏置的引擎上有效。词典纠正始终在转录后运行，并适用于所有引擎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms help speech recognition identify technical words correctly. Corrections fix common transcription mistakes automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Begriffe helfen der Spracherkennung, technische Wörter korrekt zu identifizieren. Korrekturen beheben häufige Transkriptionsfehler automatisch."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用語は音声認識が専門用語を正しく認識する助けになります。修正はよくある文字起こしミスを自動で直します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词条帮助语音识别正确识别专业词汇。词典纠正常用于自动修复常见的转录错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
